{"id":"6ab7b6083e677200","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-mm-unification-step.md","title":"Martelli–Montanari六条变换","display":"df-mm-unification-step — Martelli–Montanari六条变换","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-mm-unification-step","aliases":["56-df-mm-unification-step"],"display":"df-mm-unification-step — Martelli–Montanari六条变换","depends_on":["[[56-df-unification-problem]]","[[56-df-variables]]","[[56-df-single-variable-substitution]]","[[56-df-substitution-composition]]"],"source_section":"§7.7 Table 7.9","source_printed_pages":"290–291","source_ocr_blocks":[311,312],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-mm-unification-step"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-mm-unification-step</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mm-unification-step — Martelli–Montanari六条变换"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2a5690af909fbb4d\" href=\"?note=2a5690af909fbb4d\" title=\"56-df-single-variable-substitution\">56-df-single-variable-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0df0123405bbc66d\" href=\"?note=0df0123405bbc66d\" title=\"56-df-substitution-composition\">56-df-substitution-composition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.7 Table 7.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"290–291"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>311</span><span>312</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G_\\bot,T,S,\\bot\">\\(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G_\\bot,T,S,\\bot\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}\">\\(\\iota=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0df0123405bbc66d\" href=\"?note=0df0123405bbc66d\" title=\"56-df-substitution-composition\">56-df-substitution-composition</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x:=t]\">\\([x:=t]\\)</span> 与目标替换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2a5690af909fbb4d\" href=\"?note=2a5690af909fbb4d\" title=\"56-df-single-variable-substitution\">56-df-single-variable-substitution</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot\">\\(E,F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in S\">\\(\\delta\\in S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathcal G\">\\(G\\in\\mathcal G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(f,g\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\operatorname{ar}(f)\">\\(k=\\operatorname{ar}(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\operatorname{ar}(g)\">\\(m=\\operatorname{ar}(g)\\)</span>，各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i,t_i,t\\in T\">\\(s_i,t_i,t\\in T\\)</span>。以下六族中的方程 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in T^2\">\\(e\\in T^2\\)</span> 由该族给出的等式确定，且要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\notin G\">\\(e\\notin G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_1\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{e\\},\\iota,G\\cup\\{(s_i,t_i)\\mid1\\le i\\le k\\})\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ k=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ (s_1,\\ldots,s_k),(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in T^k,\\ e=(f(s_1,\\ldots,s_k),f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)),\\ e\\notin G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_1\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{e\\},\\iota,G\\cup\\{(s_i,t_i)\\mid1\\le i\\le k\\})\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ k=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ (s_1,\\ldots,s_k),(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in T^k,\\ e=(f(s_1,\\ldots,s_k),f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)),\\ e\\notin G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_2\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{(x,x)\\},\\iota,G)\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ x\\in\\mathcal V,\\ (x,x)\\notin G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_2\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{(x,x)\\},\\iota,G)\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ x\\in\\mathcal V,\\ (x,x)\\notin G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_3\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{(t,x)\\},\\iota,G\\cup\\{(x,t)\\})\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ x\\in\\mathcal V,\\ t\\in T\\setminus\\mathcal V,\\ (t,x)\\notin G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_3\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{(t,x)\\},\\iota,G\\cup\\{(x,t)\\})\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ x\\in\\mathcal V,\\ t\\in T\\setminus\\mathcal V,\\ (t,x)\\notin G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_4\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{(x,t)\\},[x:=t],G[x:=t])\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ x\\in\\mathcal V,\\ t\\in T,\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(t),\\ (x,t)\\notin G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_4\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{(x,t)\\},[x:=t],G[x:=t])\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ x\\in\\mathcal V,\\ t\\in T,\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(t),\\ (x,t)\\notin G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_5\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{e\\},\\iota,\\bot)\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ f,g\\in\\mathcal F,\\ f\\ne g,\\ k=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ m=\\operatorname{ar}(g),\\ (s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\in T^k,\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_m)\\in T^m,\\ e=(f(s_1,\\ldots,s_k),g(t_1,\\ldots,t_m)),\\ e\\notin G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_5\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{e\\},\\iota,\\bot)\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ f,g\\in\\mathcal F,\\ f\\ne g,\\ k=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ m=\\operatorname{ar}(g),\\ (s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\in T^k,\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_m)\\in T^m,\\ e=(f(s_1,\\ldots,s_k),g(t_1,\\ldots,t_m)),\\ e\\notin G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_6\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{(x,t)\\},\\iota,\\bot)\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ x\\in\\mathcal V,\\ t\\in T,\\ t\\ne x,\\ x\\in\\operatorname{Var}(t),\\ (x,t)\\notin G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_6\\coloneqq\\{(G\\cup\\{(x,t)\\},\\iota,\\bot)\\mid G\\in\\mathcal G,\\ x\\in\\mathcal V,\\ t\\in T,\\ t\\ne x,\\ x\\in\\operatorname{Var}(t),\\ (x,t)\\notin G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{MM}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^{6}\\mathcal R_j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{MM}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^{6}\\mathcal R_j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E\\mathrel{\\xrightarrow{\\delta}_{\\mathrm{MM}}}F\\iff(E,\\delta,F)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{MM}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E\\mathrel{\\xrightarrow{\\delta}_{\\mathrm{MM}}}F\\iff(E,\\delta,F)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{MM}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依次为同根分解、删除x=x、非变量向左的交换、变量消去、根符号冲突、自出现检查。此处准确采用§7.7表7.9：规则4删除x=t，并把[x:=t]作为输出标签；不同于§2.1表2.2保留已解方程的版本。零元分解删除相同常元方程；失败标记没有出边。前提e∉G使G确为所选方程之外的余目标。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-unification-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-single-variable-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"2a5690af909fbb4d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-single-variable-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":